#. Build the notification text. Installing from Parcha Store applies updates
#. with a restart into an update screen and another back (more with a kernel
#. update); a user who does not expect that can think the machine has crashed
#. (ticket #134). Say so up front.
#. shellcheck disable=SC2059
#: files/usr/bin/parchaos-updates-check:57
#, sh-printf-format
msgid ""
"%d update is ready. Install it from Parcha Store, or run 'sudo dnf upgrade'."
msgid_plural ""
"%d updates are ready. Install them from Parcha Store, or run 'sudo dnf "
"upgrade'."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

